_pdbx_nmr_refine.entry_id           1FF1 
_pdbx_nmr_refine.method             'simulated annealing' 
_pdbx_nmr_refine.details            
;THE R-6 SUMMATION METHOD WAS USED WITHIN A SIMULATED ANNEALING PROTOCOL. Although the NMR data was collected on an 11-mer, PTGSSSTNPFL, NOEs were absent for the N-terminal 6 residues. The structures were therefore calculated with the peptide fragment STNPFL.
;
_pdbx_nmr_refine.software_ordinal   1 
